+- Severity: high
+- Date found: 2026-08-08
+- Watch day: D06
+- Originating test task keys: `SLT-CHK-08`, `SLT-CHK-13`, `SLT-IMP-03`, `SLT-SW-09`, `SLT-SYN-11`
