+- Remote `next_billed_at` remained on August 8 immediately after the update. The D06 afternoon/D07 settlement follow-up must determine whether the real recurring transaction still charges the new card and how ArraySubs handles that later webhook; no conclusion is assumed early.
+- No natural action was forced, no scheduler row was run, no local meta/order/action was hand-edited, and no non-SLT record was touched.
